OL,3,GNEWSANew Lib Dem council chief names
OL,4,Aleadership team
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new Liberal Democrat leader of
OL,7,FLuton Borough council has named his
OL,8,Ffirst executive team.
OL,10,FIt includes two of the six Labour
OL,11,Fcouncillors who quit the party in July,
OL,12,Fplus Liberal Democrat Steve Stephens,
OL,13,Fwhose no-confidence motion saw previous
OL,14,Fleader Tahmina Saleem ousted after just
OL,15,Ffour months.
OL,17,FAmjid Ali was elected on 14 September
OL,18,Fand his administration has councillors
OL,19,Ffrom the Liberal Democrat, Independent
OL,20,FAlliance and Conservative groups, with
OL,21,FLabour now the official opposition.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
